ulk County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/faulk-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Faulk County record runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. In 2025 the middle sat at 29% of normal in January to February and 158% in August to September. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 29822 got 42% of normal that year.</p>"}
